        "title": "AI Plugin Maker Minecraft: Using AI to Build Server Plugins",
        "summary": "Discover how to use an AI plugin maker Minecraft workflow to generate Java Paper and Spigot server plugins from text prompts with zero security flaws.",
        "author": "Dr. Nadeem Nazir",
